WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:04,540
Take it out and say what?

2
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:06,500
Why do you want to kill me?

3
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:08,600
It was cooked yesterday for 17 yuan

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,880
Only fifteen left on the shelf

5
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,920
The missing two pieces are on you

6
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,420
I did so much extra work

7
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,420
What's wrong with taking two more dollars?

8
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:22,610
Why are you making such a fuss so early in the morning? You ate more of the barbecue yesterday than anyone else. I paid for it through my work.

9
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:25,890
In exchange, if you eat these two pieces on the spot, you won’t be deducting half of the three-day fee.

10
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:27,450
There’s no need to come back after another meal

11
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:29,250
That's it, no beating or scolding

12
00:00:29,810 --> 00:00:31,280
Why do I think it's so expensive to hit you?

13
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:34,980
Okay, accept the punishment and tell me what you said. I heard it.

14
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:46,140
Teacher Jiang, the water is almost dry, just in case

15
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:47,140
It's okay, cook slowly

16
00:00:47,540 --> 00:01:00,240
The orange is three times better than the last batch of green.

17
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:02,320
Reduce the fire and simmer slowly

18
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:03,880
It comes out white

19
00:01:09,060 --> 00:01:11,980
Take it and go see Lin Feng and show him

20
00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:15,200
Sell it at a good price

21
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:16,520
You have to find someone who can make the real deal first.

22
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:20,960
Teacher Jiang

23
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,760
Can our salt be exchanged for meat?
